  },
  {
   "i": 1127,
   "src": "3c6b00258c22",
   "t": "Yes, it's a sound wave generator."
  },
  {
   "i": 1130,
   "src": "26e52f1eae28",
   "t": "It cancels the specific waves of {{medalia}}."
  },
  {
   "i": 1140,
