  {
   "i": 1198,
   "src": "3aed6db0ec03",
   "t": "it kept sending out faint sound waves--"
  },
  {
   "i": 1209,
   "src": "422b3435eff5",
   "t": "and the {{medalia}} resonating with them"
  },
  {
   "i": 1212,
