   "t": "act as if making the sound themselves."
  },
  {
   "i": 1232,
   "src": "c94ebac3ce98",
   "t": "It controls {{medal|pl}} with ultrasound."
  },
  {
   "i": 1235,
   "src": "660f046fcbcf",
   "t": "It makes them forage, then recalls them."
  },
  {
   "i": 1243,
   "src": "b2ed3867430f",
   "t": "In order to eat them."
  },
  {
   "i": 1254,
   "src": "205fb59ecbd9",
   "t": "Ultrasound is its main weapon; sealing it"
  },
  {
   "i": 1257,
   "src": "2b07213da359",
   "t": "was the {{medalium}}'s role. Probably..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1264,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1270,
   "src": "cfe26843e222",
   "t": "Probably?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1280,
   "src": "f71322c5c57d",
   "t": "{{principal}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1286,
   "src": "947e0110db21",
   "t": "It's all just speculation, that's what I\nmean."
  },
  {
   "i": 1301,
   "src": "f74521a6db69",
   "t": "The monster and {{medalium}} are alien."
  },
  {
   "i": 1304,
   "src": "cbe379eabb41",
   "t": "We can't be certain with what we know."
  },
  {
   "i": 1324,
   "src": "d1be516b253d",
   "t": "That thing fell millions of years ago."
  },
  {
   "i": 1327,
   "src": "df06786f164d",
   "t": "The {{medalium}} is slowly growing brittle. "
  },
  {
   "i": 1338,
   "src": "1087fe119c17",
   "t": "Some of it may be aging over time..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1341,
   "src": "bd0af4151382",
   "t": "but the biggest factor is resonance."
  },
  {
   "i": 1349,
   "src": "ef5882f8c8b2",
   "t": "By resonating with {{medal_eater}} waves,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1352,
   "src": "f7da8fcb85c1",
   "t": "the {{medalium}} kept building up {{damage}}."
  },
  {
   "i": 1375,
   "src": "f57da81f14b8",
   "t": "I built this device to suppress that\nresonance."
  },
  {
   "i": 1383,
   "src": "29ccf4342893",
   "t": "By suppressing the resonance,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1386,
   "src": "97828e5c2553",
   "t": "we stabilize the {{medalia}} even a little."
  },
  {
   "i": 1393,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1399,
   "src": "64de6f847c8e",
   "t": "Please wait."
  },
  {
   "i": 1410,
   "src": "48a9cc663cfe",
   "t": "If you stop that, it means..."
  },
  {
