   "src": "f71322c5c57d",
   "t": "{{principal}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1433,
   "src": "39b88bd16d77",
   "t": "Its armor is thick, tough {{medalium}}."
  },
  {
   "i": 1436,
   "src": "f38aab26804e",
   "t": "With that on, don't expect fatal {{damage}}."
  },
  {
   "i": 1444,
   "src": "e8012fd8cc2c",
   "t": "If we stop the {{jamming_waves}}, its bond"
  },
  {
   "i": 1447,
   "src": "1b079fb6e4d6",
   "t": "weakens and the {{medalium}} will peel off."
  },
  {
   "i": 1455,
   "src": "f5c6d8e6014b",
   "t": "Then its main body will appear. {{damage|cap}}"
